A['transaction-status']['steps']=['Open the transaction from History or its asset’s Activity.','Read the status text alongside the header badge. Pending means the final outcome is not yet established.','For a confirmed transaction, check the actual transfer or contract result in details and the explorer.','For failed, canceled or replaced activity, inspect the related transaction and fees before deciding whether to try again.','If the provider is delayed, refresh and inspect the same transaction ID; do not assume a missing update means a transfer failed.']
body('transaction-status','The app distinguishes sending/submission progress from a confirmed network result. An outgoing request can be signed before the network has accepted it.|A failed execution can consume network fees without delivering the intended assets. A locally rejected request before signing is a different outcome.|If the network result is uncertain, preserve the transaction ID and wait for a definitive status before making a duplicate payment.')
body('canceled-replaced','Replacement can cause the original transaction and its successor to have different outcomes. Inspect the relevant identifiers and final network result before counting a payment twice.|A cancellation attempt is itself subject to network ordering and fees where supported. A confirmed original transfer cannot be undone by deleting its history entry or disconnecting a dApp.')
